<h3 id="equations">equations</h3>
<code class="language-math math-display">\begin{equation}
3+3=6
\end{equation}</code>
<code class="language-math math-display">\begin{equation}
3+3=6
\end{equation}</code>
<p>This equation will have a number in the ODT export.</p>
<code class="language-math math-display">\begin{equation}
3+3=6
\end{equation}</code>
